{
 "_about": "The run-state table (orchestration/EVENTS.md) as data. runtime/state.mjs classify() and orchestration-ui/shared/liveness.ts classify() are both tested against it; change a row here and both must agree. ageMs: how long ago the claim was touched; liveWithinMs is 120000; graceMs 60000; legacyQuietMs 900000.",
